n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- x^{2} - x y - 2 y^{2})=- x - 4 y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{\\left(\\frac{∂z}{∂x}\\right)}^{2}+{\\left(\\frac{∂z}{∂y}\\right)}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+(- 2 x - y)^2+(- x - 4 y)^2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(x (- x^{2} - x y - 2 y^{2}))\\cdot (\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x - 4 y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(- x^{3} - x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2})\\cdot (\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x - 4 y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\,(- x^{3} - x^{2} y - 2 x y^{2}) \\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x - 4 y)^{2} + 1}\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530725 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "164b9d32-3649-5cfb-a653-b45f00d604a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{- 4 x^{4} y - 4 x^{3} y^{2} - 4 x^{3} - 9 x^{2} y^{3} - 2 x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 4 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5}}{\\sqrt{(x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2} + 1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530665} {:answer/id #uuid "1b6165ab-e353-54b6-9df3-e1f48138c116" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "((x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2} + 1) (- 4 x^{4} y - 4 x^{3} y^{2} - 4 x^{3} - 9 x^{2} y^{3} - 2 x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 4 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530667} {:answer/id #uuid "45831d40-d6af-5f84-ae4f-5f8fa603f7d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{(x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2}} (- 4 x^{4} y - 4 x^{3} y^{2} - 4 x^{3} - 9 x^{2} y^{3} - 2 x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 4 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530676} {:answer/id #uuid "9d1c9a65-d5e4-574a-a9cc-25fbe390d5e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{