∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2 x^{2} + x y + 2 y^{2})=x + 4 y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{\\left(\\frac{∂z}{∂x}\\right)}^{2}+{\\left(\\frac{∂z}{∂y}\\right)}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+(4 x + y)^2+(x + 4 y)^2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(- 2 x (2 x^{2} + x y + 2 y^{2}) - y (2 x^{2} + x y + 2 y^{2})^{2})\\cdot (\\sqrt{(x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(- 4 x^{4} y - 4 x^{3} y^{2} - 4 x^{3} - 9 x^{2} y^{3} - 2 x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 4 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})\\cdot (\\sqrt{(x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\,\\sqrt{(x + 4 y)^{2} + (4 x + y)^{2} + 1} (- 4 x^{4} y - 4 x^{3} y^{2} - 4 x^{3} - 9 x^{2} y^{3} - 2 x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 4 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530730 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0971b17f-ad93-5580-ba93-06499fcf447c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{- x^{4} y - 2 x^{3} y^{2} - x^{3} - 5 x^{2} y^{3} - x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 2 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5}}{\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x - 4 y)^{2} + 1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530662} {:answer/id #uuid "38ad9d64-f81a-517e-bcc1-525559a3b57c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- x^{4} y - 2 x^{3} y^{2} - x^{3} - 5 x^{2} y^{3} - x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 2 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530673} {:answer/id #uuid "5577374c-9175-5d96-b828-750b11a1ab5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "((- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x - 4 y)^{2} + 1) (- x^{4} y - 2 x^{3} y^{2} - x^{3} - 5 x^{2} y^{3} - x^{2} y - 4 x y^{4} - 2 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530681} {:answer/id #uuid "6003ca0b-ab58-5fff-98ff-ea1e81db9a3c" :answer/type